OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the volunteers packing
OL,4,Athousands of food parcels for pets
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike all A-level students, Niamh
OL,7,FMcAleenan-McQuade and Clare Reilly are
OL,8,Fbusy.
OL,10,FBut as well as their studies, part-time
OL,11,Fjobs and hobbies they've also found
OL,12,Ftime for volunteering.
OL,14,FEach week they go to their local USPCA
OL,15,Fcentre where they help prepare food
OL,16,Fparcels for pets.
OL,18,FThe girls have been shortlisted for a
OL,19,FBBC Make a Difference Award in the
OL,20,FAnimal category.
